dataset: option_risk
rules:
- id: option_risk-input-v1
  input_id: ASTOCK-055
  provider: sse
  endpoint: option_risk
  field_mapping:
    trade_date: TRADE_DATE
    security_id: SECURITY_ID
    contract_code: CONTRACT_ID
    name: CONTRACT_SYMBOL
    delta: DELTA_VALUE
    theta: THETA_VALUE
    gamma: GAMMA_VALUE
    vega: VEGA_VALUE
    rho: RHO_VALUE
    implied_volatility: IMPLC_VOLATLTY
  context_fields:
    snapshot_at: source_snapshot_at
  null_values:
  - null
  - ''
  unverified_fields:
  - delta
  - theta
  - gamma
  - vega
  - rho
  - implied_volatility
  status: pending_validation
  version: remaining-sdk-input-v1
  evidence_refs:
  - ASTOCK-055
  notes: 原始响应与SDK所有字段单独保留；标准数字列不认证单位。快照时间沿用原响应时间；明确来源和日期，无适配器内部回退。
